<title>USA: ENStar sees Q2 oper loss of $1.5 million.</title>
<headline>ENStar sees Q2 oper loss of $1.5 million.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ENStar Inc said Monday it expects to report a second quarter net operating loss of $1.5 million before income taxes and equity in earnings of an unconsolidated subsidiary.</p>
<p>The company cited lower sales at its Americable subsidiary during the first two months of the period compared with last year and rising operating expenses.</p>
